From: Stew Forster <stew675@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 17:45:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 19/23] ggml-cuda : fuse ssm conv input concat, pp512 6303 ->
 6538

The delta-net conv input assembly (concat_non_cont, 4.7 ms/pp512) is
fused into ssm_conv via a 2-src op form (src[2] = conv states) that
reads the position-major conv states and channel-fastest qkv directly
into a position-major smem tile. The graph drops the transpose +
concat + conv_input buffer; the state save becomes a transpose-of-qkv-tail
view. PPL 6.2677 exact, generation matches, 83/83 SSM_CONV incl. new
2-src cases, 47/47 GATED_DELTA_NET, tg64 unchanged.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet
